he information and support we offer.","international-deliveries.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffaqs\u002Fsending-a-parcel\u002Finternational-deliveries",{"id":338,"type":339,"tags":340,"lang":341,"slug":213,"first_publication_date":342,"last_publication_date":342,"uid":213,"link_type":343,"key":344,"isBroken":345},"Yhj0XBIAACgA3Cbr","subpath2",[],"en-gb","2022-02-25T15:23:13+0000","Document","84e35d71-5a2c-47b5-b014-51beab17a4bc",false,{"id":347,"type":348,"tags":349,"lang":341,"slug":213,"first_publication_date":351,"last_publication_date":352,"uid":213,"link_type":343,"key":353,"isBroken":345},"YiIZ7xIAACsABYGw","faq-category",[350],"FAQs","2022-03-04T13:53:55+0000","2022-05-12T12:48:33+0000","d08ef339-8847-41a9-84e5-18b440e739ab",[355],{"variation":356,"version":357,"items":358,"primary":360,"id":434,"slice_type":435,"slice_label":8},"default-slice","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[359],{},{"content":361},[362,370,408,417,426],{"type":363,"text":299,"spans":364,"direction":369},"heading1",[365],{"start":366,"end":367,"type":368},0,24,"strong","ltr",{"type":371,"text":372,"spans":373,"direction":369},"paragraph","We offer an international service that covers over 200 countries worldwide, with a delivery time of three to seven working days, no matter where your parcel is sent. Just book your overseas delivery online, then arrange a for courier collection, or drop your parcel off at one of our 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers. Just like our UK service, you can send parcels weighing up to 15kg fully tracked, with £20 cover included as standard. Most of our ParcelShops also have Print in ParcelShop devices - meaning you can print labels even if you don't have a printer at home. You can also use the device to book and pay for the parcel, so no need to do anything online.  ",[374,382,383,394,396,401,402,407],{"start":375,"end":376,"type":377,"data":378},12,33,"hyperlink",{"link_type":379,"url":380,"target":381},"Web","international-deliveries.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services","_blank",{"start":375,"end":376,"type":368},{"start":384,"end":385,"type":377,"data":386},292,303,{"id":387,"type":388,"tags":389,"lang":341,"slug":390,"first_publication_date":391,"last_publication_date":392,"uid":149,"url":393,"link_type":343,"isBroken":345},"YhTflBEAACYA1FEy","content-page",[150],"parcelshops--parcel-pick-up--drop-off-points--evri","2022-02-22T13:38:47+0000","2026-03-09T20:42:49+0000","\u002Fparcelshops",{"start":384,"end":395,"type":368},304,{"start":397,"end":398,"type":377,"data":399},308,315,{"link_type":379,"url":400,"target":381},"international-deliveries.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"start":397,"end":398,"type":368},{"start":403,"end":404,"type":377,"data":405},470,489,{"link_type":379,"url":406,"target":381},"international-deliveries.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops\u002Fprint-in-parcelshop",{"start":403,"end":404,"type":368},{"type":371,"text":409,"spans":410,"direction":369},"To track your international parcel all the way to its destination, you can visit our tracking page.",[411],{"start":412,"end":413,"type":377,"data":414},85,99,{"link_type":379,"url":415,"target":416},"international-deliveries.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ftrack-a-parcel","_self",{"type":371,"text":418,"spans":419,"direction":369},"You can also use Evri to send your parcels sold internationally via eBay using their Global Shipping Programme (GSP). eBay will provide you with a reference number and the address of the shopping centre you’ll need to send it to, but if you’re not sure about this, just check with eBay, and they’ll be able to point you in the right direction. To find out more, visit Evri international parcels.",[420,425],{"start":421,"end":422,"type":377,"data":423},368,394,{"link_type":379,"url":424,"target":381},"international-deliveries.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Finternational-send",{"start":421,"end":422,"type":368},{"type":371,"text":427,"spans":428,